Before final policy recommendations, additional work is needed on:

1. national watershed indicators;
2. groundwater monitoring;
3. environmental flows;
4. biological water-quality indicators;
5. water-project ecological performance;
6. watershed governance models;
7. Tribal water governance;
8. agricultural conservation effectiveness;
9. urban watershed interventions;
